
---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Privacy & Ads | Silken Valley Lifestyle";
const description = "Privacy policy, cookies, advertising, and affiliate disclosures for Silken Valley Lifestyle.";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  heroTitle="Privacy & Ads"
  heroText="Your privacy matters. Learn how Silken Valley Lifestyle uses information, cookies, advertising, and affiliate links."
  heroCompact={true}
>

  <section class="privacy-page">

    <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: November 23, 2026</p>

    <div class="privacy-intro">
      <h1>Privacy Policy & Advertising Disclosure</h1>
      <p>
        Welcome to Silken Valley Lifestyle. We respect your privacy
        and believe in being transparent about how this website
        operates, how information may be collected, and how
        advertising and affiliate links support our website.
      </p>
    </div>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you visit Silken Valley Lifestyle, certain technical
        information may be collected automatically through your
        browser and website services.
      </p>
      <p>This information may include:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Internet Protocol (IP) address.</li>
        <li>Browser type and device information.</li>
        <li>Pages visited and time spent on the website.</li>
        <li>Referring websites and general browsing activity.</li>
        <li>Cookies and similar tracking technologies.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        If you contact us through our website or by email,
        we may collect the information you voluntarily provide,
        such as your name, email address, and message.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
      <p>
        Information collected through this website may be used to:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Maintain and operate our website.</li>
        <li>Improve website content and visitor experience.</li>
        <li>Understand general website traffic and performance.</li>
        <li>Display advertising and relevant promotional content.</li>
        <li>Respond to questions and communications.</li>
        <li>Maintain website security and prevent misuse.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2>3. Cookies & Tracking Technologies</h2>
      <p>
        Silken Valley Lifestyle and certain third-party services
        may use cookies, pixels, and similar technologies.
      </p>
      <p>
        Cookies are small files stored on your device that can
        help websites function, remember preferences, understand
        website activity, and support advertising.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can manage or disable cookies through your browser
        settings. Please be aware that disabling certain cookies
        may affect some website features.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2>4. Advertising & Third-Party Advertising Partners</h2>
      <p>
        Silken Valley Lifestyle may display advertisements
        through third-party advertising services, including
        Google AdSense and AdThrive, where enabled.
      </p>
      <p>
        These advertising partners may use cookies, device
        identifiers, or similar technologies to deliver,
        measure, and personalize advertisements.
      </p>
      <p>
        Third-party advertising providers may collect information
        about your visits to this and other websites in accordance
        with their own privacy policies.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not control the information collection practices
        of external advertising providers.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can learn more about Google's advertising and privacy
        practices through:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Google Privacy Policy
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Google Ads Settings
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2>5. Affiliate Links & Product Recommendations</h2>
      <p>
        Some articles, recipes, fitness pages, and product
        recommendations on Silken Valley Lifestyle may contain
        affiliate links.
      </p>
      <p>
        This means that when you click an affiliate link and
        make a qualifying purchase, we may receive a small
        commission at no additional cost to you.
      </p>
      <p>
        We participate in the Amazon Associates Program.
        As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.
      </p>
      <p>
        Affiliate relationships do not increase the price you
        pay for products. Product purchases, payments, shipping,
        and customer service are handled directly by the retailer.
      </p>
      <p>
        We aim to provide honest recommendations and useful
        information to help readers make informed decisions.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2>6. External Websites & Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may contain links to external websites,
        retailers, social media platforms, and other third-party
        services.
      </p>
      <p>
        Once you leave Silken Valley Lifestyle, the privacy
        practices and policies of the external website apply.
        We are not responsible for the content, security,
        or privacy practices of third-party websites.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2>7. Protecting Your Information</h2>
      <p>
        We take reasonable steps to maintain the security
        of our website and protect information submitted
        directly to us.
      </p>
      <p>
        However, no method of transmitting information
        over the internet or storing information electronically
        can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2>8. Your Privacy Choices</h2>
      <p>
        You may manage cookies through your browser settings
        and review available advertising preferences through
        the relevant third-party advertising services.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you have questions about personal information
        you have provided directly to us, you may contact
        us through our
        <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy & Ads policy from time
        to time to reflect changes to our website, advertising
        partners, services, or applicable privacy requirements.
      </p>
      <p>
        Any updates will be published on this page with
        a revised update date.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-contact">
      <h2>Questions About Privacy?</h2>
      <p>
        We value transparency and welcome questions about
        our website, privacy practices, and advertising.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact/" class="contact-button">
        Contact Silken Valley Lifestyle
      </a>
    </section>

  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy-page {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .last-updated {
    text-align: right;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .privacy-intro {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .privacy-intro h1 {
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .privacy-intro p {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .privacy-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .privacy-section h2,
  .privacy-contact h2 {
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-bottom: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .privacy-section p,
  .privacy-contact p {
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .privacy-section ul {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 2;
  }

  .privacy-section a {
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .privacy-contact {
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .contact-button {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .contact-button:hover {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: white;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .privacy-page {
      padding: 0.5rem;
    }

    .privacy-contact {
      padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
